WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:02,730
Good morning Wenwen

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,800
I'll take you to school

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,340
No need, Brother Xiuwen

4
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,360
Hello, my name is Qi Xuan

5
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:16,390
He is a heavenly master. Qi Xuan came yesterday

6
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:17,990
What was he doing with me?

7
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:24,870
Wen Shouxi, he asked me if you want to form a team.

8
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,940
Teammate selection doesn’t have to be limited to the school either.

9
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,890
can you consider me

10
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,490
I am twenty years old, an orphan

11
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,090
Master Qi Yunshan Qi Yunguan

12
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:35,290
Good at trapping, ghost hunting and Tai Chi

13
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:37,890
And there are prophetic eyes that can see some of the future.

14
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:39,850
you saw my future

15
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,250
only a few images

16
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:44,980
I'm sorry. Can you say I'm offended?
